{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEATH IS A POWER-UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancestral Players</strong> reimagines the classic Arena Shooter with a vengeful twist. In this arena, <strong>death is just a power-up.</strong> Every time you fall, you level up, gaining powerful abilities to hunt down the person who just took you out. But remember, your lives are limited: wipe out the competition and be the last man standing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY FOR FUN OR FOR GLORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle the score with friends in private lobbies or prove your dominance in our regular tournaments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRIMITIVE ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/c8b2675bc4a439ec04ae3c0508c5184b.poster.avif?t=1771675779\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/c8b2675bc4a439ec04ae3c0508c5184b.webm?t=1771675779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot is earned. Master an arsenal where every projectile follows its own path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Axe:</strong> Heavy, brutal, and deadly at close range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bow:</strong> Built for surgical precision at a distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Coconut Launcher:</strong> Chaos in a shell. High-impact tropical fruit at its finest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO HEROES, JUST BOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/1988e0aa45a4ca333db3c799f76c79f6.poster.avif?t=1771675779\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/1988e0aa45a4ca333db3c799f76c79f6.webm?t=1771675779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ancestral Players, everyone starts on equal footing, equipped with nothing but a dagger and a brief. Depending on the game mode, you will level up either by following a pre-established progression path (inspired by 'gun game' game modes),\u00a0or pick upgrades yourself in the skill tree game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/b4ed23f674c02701dbe0208e31abea20.poster.avif?t=1771675779\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/b4ed23f674c02701dbe0208e31abea20.webm?t=1771675779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ARENA IS ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/8102053e32ad5b77ae86da00573008a4.poster.avif?t=1771675779\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/8102053e32ad5b77ae86da00573008a4.webm?t=1771675779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players aren\u2019t the only danger in the arena, stay alert to the shifting environment. Master your movements to escape hazardous situations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-16 players per lobby\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FFA or team mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tournaments (automated in the game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peer2Peer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated servers (Only in Europe/North America)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split Screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Area + Short Solo Campaign\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2349430?t=1771675779","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771675779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/5237af4d4c87acde8b10035436833c25cd069a27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771675779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/5237af4d4c87acde8b10035436833c25cd069a27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771675779","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2947990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/1167faa8d05166914b076d5deb3856f4.avif?t=1771675779\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss out the next tournaments, join us on discord! (link to the right)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEATH IS A POWER-UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancestral Players</strong> reimagines the classic Arena Shooter with a vengeful twist. In this arena, <strong>death is just a power-up.</strong> Every time you fall, you level up, gaining powerful abilities to hunt down the person who just took you out. But remember, your lives are limited: wipe out the competition and be the last man standing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY FOR FUN OR FOR GLORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle the score with friends in private lobbies or prove your dominance in our regular tournaments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRIMITIVE ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/c8b2675bc4a439ec04ae3c0508c5184b.poster.avif?t=1771675779\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/c8b2675bc4a439ec04ae3c0508c5184b.webm?t=1771675779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot is earned. Master an arsenal where every projectile follows its own path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Axe:</strong> Heavy, brutal, and deadly at close range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bow:</strong> Built for surgical precision at a distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Coconut Launcher:</strong> Chaos in a shell. High-impact tropical fruit at its finest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO HEROES, JUST BOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/1988e0aa45a4ca333db3c799f76c79f6.poster.avif?t=1771675779\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/1988e0aa45a4ca333db3c799f76c79f6.webm?t=1771675779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ancestral Players, everyone starts on equal footing, equipped with nothing but a dagger and a brief. Depending on the game mode, you will level up either by following a pre-established progression path (inspired by 'gun game' game modes),\u00a0or pick upgrades yourself in the skill tree game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/b4ed23f674c02701dbe0208e31abea20.poster.avif?t=1771675779\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/b4ed23f674c02701dbe0208e31abea20.webm?t=1771675779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ARENA IS ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/8102053e32ad5b77ae86da00573008a4.poster.avif?t=1771675779\" width=750 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/extras/8102053e32ad5b77ae86da00573008a4.webm?t=1771675779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players aren\u2019t the only danger in the arena, stay alert to the shifting environment. Master your movements to escape hazardous situations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-16 players per lobby\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FFA or team mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tournaments (automated in the game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peer2Peer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated servers (Only in Europe/North America)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split Screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Area + Short Solo Campaign\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ENSLIP"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349430/fdb1d8ae5d98c67017dcfdbbacce8ba28f6266e3/header.jpg?t=1771675779","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2349430/1114374869/c464712a62e0352d0530e198dcb0028d26f493b8/1767719367/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771675778","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2349430/1114374869/c464712a62e0